    LLM: "After come-out, move 1-3 forward before using 8 backward to reach in-spot.\n\nRunner peg: move 4+ forward, use 8; harass opponents. Home run: partner lands on your peg at come-out, sends you to in-spot.\n\nDouble play: peg in come-out; partner's runner lands, sends it home. Chain reactions with 7/9 splits.",
